{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 71,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        115.84590148925781,
        27.289522171020508,
        337.6759338378906,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "8. EVIDENCE FOR RECOMMENDATIONS ON TREATMENT OF FEVER CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.0415344238281,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "Resistance profiles of pathogens causing AOM are variable across studies, but",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        399.00286865234375,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "show a high level of co-trimoxazole resistance (28–45%), although data are only from",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        218.92759704589844,
        85.52207946777344,
        277.9976501464844,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "see table A6.2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        85.74208068847656,
        399.122314453125,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "two countries (Israel and Costa Rica) ( ). Resistance to penicillins is",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        98.74208068847656,
        399.01287841796875,
        112.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "lower (2–29%) [Gelbart B, 2010; WHO unpublished review]. Amoxicillin is preferred",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        111.74208068847656,
        399.0828857421875,
        125.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "over co-trimoxazole because of its lower rates of in-vitro resistance, and because it is",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        124.74208068847656,
        399.0429992675781,
        138.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "the first line outpatient antibiotic for non-severe pneumonia, and may therefore be",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        137.74208068847656,
        123.93289184570312,
        151.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "more accessible.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        159.23611450195312,
        196.86289978027344,
        171.37611389160156
      ],
      "text": "Short versus long course treatment",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        172.24610900878906,
        399.0527648925781,
        185.73611450195312
      ],
      "text": "Thirty-five trials primarily conducted in developed countries (11 in Europe, 10 each",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        185.24610900878906,
        399.0528564453125,
        198.73611450195312
      ],
      "text": "in North America and Asia, and four were multi-centre from different continents)",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        198.24610900878906,
        399.1229553222656,
        211.73611450195312
      ],
      "text": "were evaluated. The duration of antibiotic use in the long course arm was 10 days",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        211.24610900878906,
        399.052978515625,
        224.73611450195312
      ],
      "text": "in 33 analytic components, 7–14 days in two analytic components, seven days in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        224.24610900878906,
        399.0527648925781,
        237.73611450195312
      ],
      "text": "two analytic components, and five days in one analytic component. Of the 35 trials,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        237.24610900878906,
        399.1129150390625,
        250.73611450195312
      ],
      "text": "three used short-acting oral antibiotics, 21 used azithromycin, and 11 used parenteral",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        250.24610900878906,
        203.78294372558594,
        263.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "ceftriaxone in the short course arm.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        263.24609375,
        399.0415954589844,
        276.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "There was no evidence of an increased risk of treatment failure with a shorter",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        276.24609375,
        399.1129455566406,
        289.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "course of antibiotics (≤ 3 days). The overall relative risk for treatment failure with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        289.24609375,
        399.0130310058594,
        302.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "a short course of antibiotics in comparison to a longer course was 1.06 (95% CI",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        302.24609375,
        399.0030212402344,
        315.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "0.95 to 1.17, P=0.298; test for heterogeneity: Cochran Q=37.02, I2=0.1%, P=0.468).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        315.24609375,
        399.0228576660156,
        328.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "Use of a short acting oral antibiotic in the short course arm was associated with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        328.24609375,
        399.0329895019531,
        341.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "a significantly increased risk of treatment failure (2.27, 95% CI 1.04 to 4.99). The",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        341.24609375,
        399.07293701171875,
        354.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "slightly increased risk of treatment failure with parenteral ceftriaxone (1.13, 95% CI",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        354.24609375,
        399.01287841796875,
        367.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "0.99 to 1.30) was not statistically significant; however, the lower limit of confidence",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        367.24609375,
        399.0928955078125,
        380.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "interval was close to 1. There is very low quality evidence for the equivalence of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        380.24609375,
        399.0529479980469,
        393.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "short-course (≤ 3 days) versus-long course (> 3 days) antibiotics [Gulani, WHO",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.07939910888672,
        393.026123046875,
        174.05938720703125,
        406.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "see Grade table A7.19",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        393.24609375,
        179.3144989013672,
        406.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "2009] ( ).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        406.24609375,
        399.0814514160156,
        419.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "Limited data did not suggest that a short course of antibiotics resulted in an",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        419.24609375,
        399.1429138183594,
        432.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "increased risk of: (i) treatment failure in culture positive cases or in high-risk groups",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        432.24609375,
        399.04278564453125,
        445.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "(children below two years of age, perforated eardrum, recurrent otitis media, and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        445.24609375,
        399.0927734375,
        458.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "specific bacterial pathogens), (ii) bacteriologic failure, (iii) relapse, (iv) recurrence, or",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        458.24609375,
        194.1629180908203,
        471.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "(v) persistent middle ear effusion.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        482.76470947265625,
        163.95286560058594,
        494.75469970703125
      ],
      "text": "8.2.2\t Benefits and risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        498.4093017578125,
        88.77290344238281,
        510.5492858886719
      ],
      "text": "Benefits",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        511.4193115234375,
        399.0328674316406,
        524.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "There is no evidence for the safety of not giving antibiotics for AOM in settings where",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        524.4193115234375,
        399.1327819824219,
        537.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "the prevalence of AOM and its complications are high. The benefits of antibiotic",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        537.4193115234375,
        152.38291931152344,
        550.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "treatment for AOM are:",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.54180145263672,
        556.0885620117188,
        211.29180908203125,
        569.5785522460938
      ],
      "text": "reduced pain in acute ear infection;",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        558.3150024414062,
        63.541900634765625,
        567.3150024414062
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbats",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.54180145263672,
        569.0885620117188,
        246.6517791748047,
        582.5785522460938
      ],
      "text": "reduced risk of acute, serious complications;",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        571.3150024414062,
        63.541900634765625,
        580.3150024414062
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbats",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.54180145263672,
        582.0885620117188,
        399.1018371582031,
        595.5785522460938
      ],
      "text": "possible reduced risk of long-term sequelae, including chronic suppurative otitis",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        584.3150024414062,
        63.541900634765625,
        593.3150024414062
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbats",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        595.0885620117188,
        197.021484375,
        608.5785522460938
      ],
      "text": "media (CSOM) and mastoiditis.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        223.4884033203125,
        644.9403076171875,
        231.55239868164062,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "57",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}